 "short_name": "Overstrand",
 "_doc": "Western Cape (Hermanus / Kleinmond / Stanford). Carries the gyro_utilities email that Mangaung fingerprints on, so it MUST be matched on its own VAT 4140106396 and Mangaung rejects that VAT. Charge table: 'ELECT/ELEK <code> <consum> <AMOUNT> <VAT>' (sum AMOUNT for ex-VAT electricity, sum VAT for the VAT). kWh = the CONSUMPTION column of the SERVICE 'E' meter line(s); TOU bills print peak/std/offpeak registers which we sum. English TAX INVOICE and Afrikaans KOPIE statement share this layout. | CBX 1.0.77 (tested on the Telkom folder): half the bills print the Afrikaans header (REKENING NOMMER / MAANDELIKSE REKENING / DEBITEUR BTW REG) with the values on the next line — patterns added for those.",
 "fingerprint": {
  "all": [
   "4140106396"
  ],
  "any": []
 },
